  46:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c **** /** Handler for a WriteProperty Service request.
  47:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * @ingroup DSWP
  48:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * This handler will be invoked by apdu_handler() if it has been enabled
  49:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * by a call to apdu_set_confirmed_handler().
  50:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * This handler builds a response packet, which is
  51:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * - an Abort if
  52:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  *   - the message is segmented
  53:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  *   - if decoding fails
  54:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * - an ACK if Device_Write_Property() succeeds
  55:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * - an Error if Device_Write_Property() fails
  56:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  *   or there isn't enough room in the APDU to fit the data.
  57:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  *
  58:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * @param service_request [in] The contents of the service request.
  59:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * @param service_len [in] The length of the service_request.
  60:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * @param src [in] BACNET_ADDRESS of the source of the message
  61:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  * @param service_data [in] The BACNET_CONFIRMED_SERVICE_DATA information
  62:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  *                          decoded from the APDU header of this message.
  63:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_wp.c ****  */
